<title>USA: Trans Global sets 1-for-6 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Trans Global sets 1-for-6 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans Global Services Inc said on Thursday its stockholders have approved a one-for-six reverse split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The reverse split was effective at the close of business on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trans Global provides engineering services.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
